# What the web image's build (the repository root) must not send: everything
# but the files its Dockerfile copies, and no installed packages or build output.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/app
!apps/web
!packages/api-client
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.expo
**/docs
**/*.md
